[{"answer":"Last Friday my dad came home from work and said that he had a surprise for us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/1.mp3"},{"answer":"We tried to guess what the surprise might be.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/2.mp3"},{"answer":"My brother guessed that we were going out for dinner.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/3.mp3"},{"answer":"My dad said \"no\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/4.mp3"},{"answer":"My other brother asked if my father had tickets to a hockey game.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/5.mp3"},{"answer":"My dad said \"no\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/6.mp3"},{"answer":"My sister asked if we were going on a trip.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/7.mp3"},{"answer":"My dad said \"no\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/8.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother knew what the surprise was, so she just stood and smiled at us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I guessed that we might be getting a swimming pool.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/10.mp3"},{"answer":"My dad said \"no\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/11.mp3"},{"answer":"We were getting very frustrated trying to guess what the surprise might be.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/12.mp3"},{"answer":"My brother asked how big the surprise was.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/13.mp3"},{"answer":"My dad said that the surprise was quite small.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/14.mp3"},{"answer":"We were not sure what the surprise could be.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/15.mp3"},{"answer":"\"Will we all like it?\" I asked.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/16.mp3"},{"answer":"\"Yes\" my dad replied.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Every one of you will love this surprise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/18.mp3"},{"answer":"We heard a noise. It was a crying noise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/19.mp3"},{"answer":"\"Your surprise wants to see you,\" my dad said.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/20.mp3"},{"answer":"He opened the door to the bedroom, and a tiny puppy came running out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/21.mp3"},{"answer":"We were all very excited. Our surprise was a puppy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/22.mp3"},{"answer":"It was a little baby spaniel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/23.mp3"},{"answer":"The puppy loved all of us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/24.mp3"},{"answer":"She ran around and licked all of our faces.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/25.mp3"},{"answer":"We had always wanted a dog.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/26.mp3"},{"answer":"We take turns feeding the puppy and taking her out for walks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/27.mp3"},{"answer":"She is growing quickly and will soon be an adult dog.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/28.mp3"},{"answer":"We all agree that the puppy was the nicest surprise my dad could have given us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/87-a-surprise-2019-03-29-13-14-29/29.mp3"}]
